            "review_title": "Review at Overthinkers' Cafe",
            "review_text": "Ki_boro\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nA cozy spot for overthinkers (like me)\nMay 2025 • Couples\nReally cozy place with friendly staffs. I had a milk espresso and a matcha latte—both were great! If you like your drinks sweet, just ask for a bit more sugar. The café also offers a selection of bread and cakes. I highly recommend trying the croissant and tiramisu if you're stopping by 🍵\nInsider tip:\nCoconut coffee is also great 👏 Really comfy for working long hours or hanging out with friends.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 24, 2025",
